<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Schering.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Schering.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on Schering AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	    125.00 DEM    1.33 DEM     10.64 PCT     9.40 X</p>
<p> PUT	     125.00 DEM    1.03 DEM	8.24 PCT    12.14 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.NOV.96-08.MAY.98   PAYDATE	13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  125.00 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
